<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine July consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Argentine July consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in July, the Economy Ministry said:</p>
<p>    Food				  0.1</p>
<p>    Clothing			   -0.9</p>
<p>    Housing			     0.1</p>
<p>    Household goods		   0.0</p>
<p>    Health				0.1</p>
<p>    Transport and communications -0.1</p>
<p>    Entertainment		     2.7</p>
<p>    Education			   0.1</p>
<p>    Others				0.0</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
